      <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-white/10 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">&copy; 2015-<span id="currentYear"></span> Global Equinox Trade. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 max-w-md text-center md:text-right">Trading involves risk. Past performance is not indicative of future results. Only trade with capital you can afford to lose.</p>
      </div>
